1024,501393,Dardanos,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: 2 miles S Kepez TKY Dardanos was a city of the Troad.
1025,501400,Dion,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: on Akte Pr. An ancient settlement, located on the Athos/Akte peninsula."
1026,501403,Drabeskos,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Draveskos? An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 51 B3 Drabeskos"
