1042,501569,Pistyros,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: near Petropege Hellenistic remnants, likely of the Thasian colony of Pistyros, have been excavated between modern Kavala and Petropege, just east of the modern village of Pontolivado in Greece."
1043,501570,Pityoussa/Lampsacus,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Lapseki TKY A Greek city located on the eastern side of the Hellespont.
