1067,511168,Astacenus/Olbianus Sinus,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: İzmit Körfezi The Gulf of İzmit (Turkish: İzmit Körfezi) is also known as Izmit Bay. This body of water is a bay located at the easternmost edge of the Sea of Marmara.
