1378,550846,Psyra (island),"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Psara GRE An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 56 B4 Psyra Ins."
1379,550848,Pteleos L.,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Erenköy A lake of the Troad, mentioned by Strabo following his discussion of the grove of Hector."
