1404,554238,Hyperdexion,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: on Lesbos An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 56 unlocated Hyperdexion"
1405,554243,Itone,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: on Tmolus M.? An ancient settlement whose precise location is unknown. According to Robert (1962) it is located near Tmolus M.
