1472,570231,Epitalion,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Epitalio An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 58 A2 Epitalion"
1473,570236,Erineos,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: near Lampirion An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 58 B1 Erineos"
1474,570237,Erymanthos (river),The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Erymanthos A right tributary of the Alpheios river in the Peloponnese.
