1666,573055,Aipasion Pedion,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Triphylia: near Lepreon and Chaa The Aipasion Pedion, or Aipasion Plain, was located near the cities of Chaa and Lepreon according to Strabo."
1667,573060,Akakesion,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Arcadia: ridge, hill near Lykosoura An ancient settlement of Arcadia, Akakesion had vanished by Pausanias' time. Akakesion was located in the district of Parrhasia, at the foot of a hill with which it shared its name."
1668,573061,Akakesion,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Arcadia: city near Lykosoura An ancient settlement near Lykosoura, attested by literary or documentary sources, whose precise location cannot be determined today"
