1672,573066,Akontion (Arcadian settlement),"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Arcadia: city in Parrasia, near Lykosoura An ancient settlement of Arcadia in Parrasia, near Lykosoura. It is mentioned by both Pausanias and Stephanus, but its precise location cannot be determined today."
