1691,573145,Boinoa/Oinoe,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Elis: city between Pylos and Lasion, same as Ephyra? According to Strabo, Boinoa/Oinoe was an ancient settlement between Pylos and Lasion in Elis that was either also called Ephyra or located near another place with that name. The precise location of this settlement cannot be determined today."
