1840,579966,Kantharos Limen,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Megas Limen. Kantharos Limen was the largest harbor area of the Piraeus.
1841,579970,Keiriadai,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: W Pnyx, outside walls [VIII - city - 2] Keiriadai was a deme of ancient Attica, assigned to the phyle Hippothontis. It was located outside of the Themistoclean walls, to the west of the Hill of the Nymphs."
1842,579972,Kephisia,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Kephisia [I - inland - 6(8)] Kephisia was an inland deme of the tribe Erechtheis in Attica
1843,579973,Kephisos (river),The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Kephisos The Eleusinian Kephisos (modern Sarandaporos).
