1875,580062,Peiraieus/Piraeus,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: deme and fort, Mounychia [VIII - city - 8?(10?)] The ancient, fortified port settlement of ancient Athens. It was also the coastal deme of the tribe Hippothoontis."
