1879,580069,Phabra (island),The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Phleves The island of Fleves in the Saronic Gulf.
1880,580072,Phaleron,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: near Old Phaleron [IX - city - 9] Phalerum was a port settlement and deme of ancient Athens, located approximately 5 km southwest of the Acropolis of Athens, on the Saronic Gulf."
1881,580075,Philaidai,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Brauron c. ¼ mile W basilica [II - inland - 3] An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 59 C3 Philaidai"
