1897,580110,Steiria,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: W Porto Raphti [III - coast - 3] Steiria was a deme of ancient Attica. It was located on the east coast of Attica, between Prasiae and Brauron, and belonged to the phyle of Pandionis."
