1900,580119,Thorikos,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: deme and fort, Thorikos [V - coast - 5(6)] Thorikos was a coastal deme of the tribe Akamantis, in southeastern Attica. A significant Mycenaean prescence existed at the site during the Bronze Age."
