1946,589872,Knosos/Col. Iulia Nobilis Cnosos,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: settlement and quarry at Knossos/Makryteikhos A major ancient settlement of Crete, located some 5 km southeast of Heraklion, Knossos was occupied from the Neolithic period to the time of the Roman Empire."
