1983,599505,Temple of Apollo Lepsios,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: on Lepsia GRE A temple of Apollo on the Aegean island of Lepsia, generally thought to have been located in the vicinity of the modern church of Hagios Nikolaos. It is attested in various ancient sources, including a recently published epigraphic document demarcating the temple lands."
