2258,707612,Phrourion?/Boosoura? (promontory),The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Cape Aspros Ancient sources separately provide the names Phrourion and Boosoura for capes on the southern coast of Cyprus. Modern scholars tentatively identify both names with modern Cape Aspros/Aspron.
