2260,707644,Zephyrion Pr.,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Cape Zephyros An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 72 A3 Zephyrion Pr."
2261,711256,Palaia,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: settlement NE Salamis An ancient settlement of Cyprus whose precise location cannot be determined today. It was probably located somewhere to the southwest of Salamis/Konstantia.
