2369,825382,Sirachoi,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: E Azov An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 84 E4 Sirachoi"
2370,825397,Tanais,The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Nedvigovka Tanais (located near modern Nedvigovska) was a city of the third century B.C. founded on the banks of the Tanais river by Bosporanian Greeks.
2371,825399,Tarpeites,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: E Azov An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 84 D3 Tarpeites"
2372,825404,Thateis,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: E Azov An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 84 D2 Thateis"
