2374,828243,Arrechoi,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Azov An ancient place, cited: BAtlas 84 unlocated Arrechoi"
2375,828286,Makropogones,"The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: near Kerketai? The Makropogones (or ""Long Beards"") were a tribe dwelling in the western Caucasus region."
